{"id":"638950","name":"油条","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/638950/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加小苏打。","img":"images/638950/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡打粉。","img":"images/638950/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋搅匀。","img":"images/638950/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加盐。","img":"images/638950/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加食用油，加适量水。","img":"images/638950/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"活成面团，醒发半小时。","img":"images/638950/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"半小时后，手抹油，揉面。","img":"images/638950/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放冰箱六小时以上。","img":"images/638950/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"不要揉面，用手扯长。","img":"images/638950/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切断。","img":"images/638950/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两个叠在一起，用筷子在中间压一下。","img":"images/638950/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油温七成热，下锅炸，要不停的翻动。","img":"images/638950/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"油条出锅。","img":"images/638950/step_13.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、蒸锅、平底锅、煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}